# ── EAS Build upload excludes ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# When this file exists, `eas build` uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore to decide
# what enters the upload tarball. It must therefore re-list every exclusion
# the gitignores guarantee (secrets, keys, caches, junk) plus the monorepo
# paths the mobile cloud build does not need: apps/web alone is ~290 MB and
# packages/db ~100 MB, and uploading them ran the archive out of disk twice
# (ENOSPC at "Compressing project files", 2026-10-21).
#
# The mobile EAS build needs: apps/mobile (with its tracked android/), its
# workspace graph — @kortix/sdk → @kortix/llm-catalog, @kortix/shared — and
# @kortix/agent-tunnel (it is the root package.json devDependency, so
# pnpm install needs it on disk), plus patches/ and the root config files.
# Everything else is cut from the upload.
#
# When apps/mobile gains a workspace dependency, add its package dir back
# into the archive keep-set (i.e. remove that line from this list).

# Dependencies / generated / build outputs (mirrors root + mobile .gitignore)
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.git/
.next/
.turbo/
.expo/
.metro-health-check*/
dist/
build/
out/
coverage/
.jacoco/
.tsgo/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets / native signing material
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.local.json.tmp
loc.env.local
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
*.mobileprovision
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/app/.cxx/
ios/build/
ios/Pods/
ios/Frameworks/

# Logs / editor / OS junk
*.log
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode-standalone/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.bak
*.backup
*.tmp
*.orig.*

# Mobile dev-only workspace notes and registry captures (gitignored bits)
scratchpad/
**/scratchpad/

# Monorepo paths the mobile build never imports
docs/
scripts/
tests/
.github/
apps/web
packages/db
packages/api-contract
packages/llm-gateway
packages/manifest-schema
packages/registry
packages/starter
packages/ui
